	(text "1  Cover\n2  Top-Level\n3  ADIN2111 (Single-Pair Ethernet)\n4  PoDL (Power over Data Line)\n5  Bus Power Monitor\n6  Power (buck converters)\n7  Motor driver + ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 102.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c83a258e-645f-44a2-ae66-b84233cfbdd1")
	)
	(text "* Thermal limit of U10: bench validation pending.\nThe 5 V rail, the payload and the 3.3 V logic all draw from the 12 W own-load budget: 7.5 W on the 5 V rail is about 8.4 W from the bus."
